# Cross-origin isolation enables SharedArrayBuffer, which lets the background
# removal engine run multithreaded WASM (much faster). Honoured by hosts that
# support a _headers file (Cloudflare Pages, Netlify). Plain GitHub Pages
# ignores this file — the app still works, just single-threaded.
/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp
  Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy: cross-origin
